<title>NETHERLANDS: Sphinx posts Dfl 2.4 mln H1 loss.</title>
<headline>Sphinx posts Dfl 2.4 mln H1 loss.</headline>
<dateline>MAASTRICHT 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to Sept 30,1996</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net loss per shr (guilders)	0.26 vs  1.58 PROFIT</p>
<p>    Net loss				 2.4  vs 14.5 PROFIT</p>
<p>    Turnover			     400.1  vs 369.9</p>
<p>    Operating profit		    12.8  vs  31.4</p>
<p>    Interest charges		    11.5  vs  10.1</p>
<p>    Tax					3.7  vs   7.0</p>
<p>Note - Full name is NV Koninklijke Sphinx Gustavsberg. The company manufactures tiles and sanitaryware.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
